{"id":"n71327-1-7","stage":0,"title":"아무 · 任何","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71327-1-7-1","ko":"내일 모임에는 무슨 옷을 입고 가지?","zh":"明天聚会要穿什么衣服去呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"모임에는","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모임에는","audio":"/audio/8754a81ecc9d850b2747.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입고","audio":"/audio/abf4f911317e9d7bed28.mp3"}},{"text":"가지?","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","orig